WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.500
Download the three files of the latest release into an empty directory.

00:10.500 --> 00:13.500
Check them against the published checksums before running anything.

00:13.500 --> 00:21.000
quickstart.sh writes .env with a new database password and master key, and never prints them.

00:21.000 --> 00:35.000
It starts PostgreSQL and ReleaseFlow and waits until the application is healthy. Here the images were already downloaded; a first start downloads them.

00:35.000 --> 00:37.900
ReleaseFlow is running. Create the first administrator at /register.
